---
---
<section id="sponsor" class="sponsor">
  <div class="wrap sponsor-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Funding</p>
    <h2>Sponsor tier. In preparation.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      This stays free for the people using it. A sponsor tier is being scoped — written confirmation is required before any sponsor commitments are published. Join the waitlist to be told first when it opens.
    </p>
    <div class="sponsor-cta">
      <a href="mailto:waitlist@stack.local?subject=Sponsor%20waitlist" class="btn btn-primary">Sponsor waitlist →</a>
      <a href="#submit" class="btn btn-ghost">Use it first</a>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small">No pricing, badges, or sponsor credits are published in this build.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .sponsor {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper) 0%, var(--surface) 100%);
  }
  .sponsor-inner { max-width: 60rem; }
  .sponsor-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .small { font-size: 0.78rem; font-family: var(--mono); margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
